        "rarity": "RARE",
        "artist": "Andreas Zafiratos",
        "flavorText": "\"The Jeskai like talking about their Way? Let's see them talk their way out of this dilemma.\"\n—Girdah, Abzan beastrider",
        "imageUri": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/c/4/c495f3bf-86a4-4d2f-821f-c01515f084c9.jpg?1783907177",
        "rulings": [
            {
                "date": "2025-04-04",
                "text": "To find the difference between a creature's power and its toughness, subtract the smaller of those two numbers from the larger one. For example, the difference between the power and toughness of a 3/5 creature is 2. The difference between the power and toughness of a 5/3 creature is also 2."
